package migration
    provides [m26_slice, claim_m26_identity_problems, validate_m26_claim, campaign_m26_manifest]
    uses [coverage, reducer, registry, spec, text]

/// Z01 migration-coverage reconciliation, slice m26 (HISTORY-009..HISTORY-021).
/// Per-row facet, variant, environment and delegated-declaration mappings
